# A double-click on a window's title bar fills the screen with it (as
# Super+F), a second one gives it back its place. The first extra window's
# title bar is at 32..684, 34..58; filling the screen its right border is
# at 1907.
@usb kbd mouse
$ layout us
$ files /
~ in a new window
@screenshot 1920x1080 pixels 1907,300=a8d0f0
# The pointer starts in the middle (960,540).
@mouse -660 -495
@button left down
@button left up
@button left down
@button left up
$ sleep 1
@screenshot 1920x1080 pixels 1907,300=1f3a5f
@button left down
@button left up
@button left down
@button left up
$ sleep 1
@screenshot 1920x1080 pixels 1907,300=a8d0f0 683,300=1f3a5f
